WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.030
Notifications is the full list of everything KiddieTrac has told you about, newest first.

2
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.320
Use the filter to see only what you haven't read yet.

3
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:17.490
Mark all read clears the list in one tap, or open any one to go straight to it.

4
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:24.040
Little red counters on the bottom bar also show what's new, and clear when you open that section.

5
00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:32.510
For alerts on your phone, even when the app is closed, install KiddieTrac and tap Allow when it asks to send notifications.
